# Vynohradov v0.5 and v0.6.1 finite-input compatibility
v0.5 df4b19e572e82f1a2007eae23a28e71bbba6be39
v0.6.1 3c49c0fd83ccbc3429d2a9068c4f2d1a56f2ebf1
